      "t": "p",
      "text": "The BC Ministry of Education and Child Care school list shows 62 schools with a Langley street address: 49 public schools and 13 independent schools. It also shows 5 college and university campuses. In that list, 7 schools marked as offering French Immersion, 1 Francophone school run by the Conseil scolaire francophone, 2 alternate programs and 2 online schools."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Public schools here are run by School District 35 (Langley) and School District 93 (Conseil scolaire francophone). Count by district: School District 35 (Langley): 48, School District 93 (Conseil scolaire francophone): 1."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Alternate programs, continuing education centres and online schools that have a street address sit under \"other public schools and programs\"; the level of every school is read from its name."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "By mailing community, the Langley list splits as Langley (52), Aldergrove (8) and Fort Langley (2)."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Public secondary schools with a Langley address: Aldergrove Community Secondary, Brookswood Secondary, D.W. Poppy Secondary, Langley Education Centre, Langley Fundamental Middle/Secondary Sch, Langley Secondary, R E Mountain Secondary and Walnut Grove Secondary."
    },
